The '''Baby Magma Slug''' is a {{Rarity|r|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that is spawned when a [[Magma Slug]] is killed.

== Spawning ==
When a [[Magma Slug]] is killed, it splits into 3 '''Baby Magma Slugs'''.

